This product is a Rust reimplementation of Reduce2 (mmtbx.reduce2) and related code
from the Computational Crystallography Toolbox (cctbx,
https://github.com/cctbx/cctbx_project). It also contains tables generated from cctbx
sources (residue classes, space-group operations, glycosidic chirality values, default
bond lengths, nucleic-acid atom-name aliases). That material is distributed under the
